3008,"# Hadith 301

**Jābir ibn 'Abdillāh (may Allāh be pleased with him) reported:**

> The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) used to present himself at the [Makkah] stopping-place, saying: *""Is there not a man who will carry me to his people? For Quraysh have prevented me from conveying the speech of my Lord.""*

**Abū 'Īsā (al-Tirmidhī) said:** This is a *gharīb ṣaḥīḥ* (unauthenticated yet sound) hadith.

---

