3214,"Narrated Ibn 'Abbas:""All types of women were prohibited for the Messenger of ALlah (ﷺ) except for the believing women among those who emigrated. (Allah) said: 'It is not lawful for you (to marry other) women after this"
3215,"Narrated 'Aishah:""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) did not die until the women had been made lawful for him"
3216,"Narrated by Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi, narrated by Abu Tumaylah, from al-Zubayr ibn Junadah, from Ibn Buraydah, from his father, who said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: ""When we arrived at Bayt al-Maqdis, Jibril (Gabriel), peace be upon him, pressed his finger into the rock, thereby piercing it, and secured the Buraq with it."" Abu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) said: This is a hasan (good) gharib (uncommon) hadith."
3217,"Narrated Al-Ja'd bin Abi 'Uthman:from Anas bin Malik: ""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) got married"
