3462,"Muhammad ibn Bashshar narrated to us, Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, Sufyan narrated from Abu Ishaq, from al-Aghar Abu Muslim, that he bore witness upon Abu Hurayrah and Abu Sa'id al-Khudri that they bore witness upon the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, that he said:

