Yusuf ibn Ya'qub narrated to us, Hafs ibn 'Umar narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated from Abu Ishaq, he said: I heard al-Aghar Abu Muslim say: I bear witness upon Abu Sa'id and Abu Hurayrah, may Allah be pleased with them both, that they bore witness upon the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, and he mentioned the like of it."
